From 3245a90df32aac8ed01881967645cfb1ad7bfa64 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moudy Ho <moudy.ho@mediatek.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Sep 2025 15:25:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] GENIO: media: platform: mtk-mdp3: migrate MDP3 algorithms
 in kernel

Previously, MDP3 relied on remoteproc to transfer frame data to
the SCP firmware, where various algorithms were executed for
image processing.

This commit moves those algorithms into the kernel, reorganizing the
code into three major areas:
	Path topology management, frame tile segmentation, and
	component-specific image processing.

By integrating these algorithms directly into the kernel,
we improve performance, maintainability, and simplify the
overall data flow.

Change-Id: I9a8dcf58d3146b3334099db2f6530cf060c5b0e9
Signed-off-by: Moudy Ho <moudy.ho@mediatek.com>
